+## Rev0674 changes
 
-- Adds `SyncStagedTransferCleanupOptions` and `SyncStagedTransferCleanupResult`.
-- Adds `cleanup_sync_staged_transfer_artifacts` for terminal-state-checked staged transfer cleanup.
-- Cleanup validates the remote file entry and apply evidence, checks local/staging root topology, verifies the materialized target still matches the remote content evidence, refuses to run if the `.part` staging file still exists, removes only receipts whose material matches the exact remote entry/apply/chunk tuple, rejects unexpected receipt-directory artifacts, and prunes empty staging parents under the staging root.
-- Extends `SyncFakePeerFileFetchSessionOptions` with `cleanup_staged_transfer_artifacts_after_materialization`, defaulting to `true`.
-- Extends fake-session aggregate and per-file result evidence with cleanup receipt and directory counts plus `staging_artifacts_cleaned`.
-- Extends `--selftest-sync-domain-model` to require committed fake-session cleanup: all transferred receipts are removed and the staging root is empty after convergence.
-- Promotes a new active rev0673 binary and removes the rev0672 active binary from the slim package.
+- Adds `SyncSessionCheckpointOptions` and `SyncSessionCheckpointResult`.
+- Adds `persist_sync_fake_peer_session_checkpoint` for completed fake-session checkpoint persistence.
+- Persists source, destination-before, and destination-after manifest rows plus manifest entry digests.
+- Persists local apply intents, file materialization results, materialization idempotency keys, cleanup idempotency keys, and per-chunk receipt idempotency keys.
+- Rejects checkpoint database paths inside the source, destination, or staging roots, so local metadata does not become synced content or staging debris.
+- Reopens the SQLite database after commit and verifies the checkpoint idempotency key plus apply/file/receipt row counts.
+- Extends `--selftest-sync-domain-model` to cover durable SQLite checkpoint persistence and synced-root metadata-path rejection.
+- Promotes a new active rev0674 binary and removes the rev0673 active binary from the slim package.
 
